    "✅ trading_frequency_bonus: 0.05 → 0.15 (3x increase)",
    "✅ profit_reward_multiplier: 1.5 → 3.0 (2x increase)",
    "✅ action_diversity_bonus: 0.01 → 0.05 (5x increase)",
